[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4020.309, "timestamp": "01:07:00", "text": "印度虚拟主播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4025.91, "timestamp": "01:07:05", "text": "呃，#标签 或者你可以用invt invtuber"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4030.069, "timestamp": "01:07:10", "text": "你也可以用印度虚拟主播做同样的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4033.67, "timestamp": "01:07:13", "text": "这一点也适用于推特。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4035.43, "timestamp": "01:07:15", "text": "Instagram上也有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4037.27, "timestamp": "01:07:17", "text": "正在做类似的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4040.309, "timestamp": "01:07:20", "text": "这样你就能看到更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4042.63, "timestamp": "01:07:22", "text": "YouTuber之类的。现在我过去常常这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4046.71, "timestamp": "01:07:26", "text": "这就像每天的开始一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4049.029, "timestamp": "01:07:29", "text": "一个月或一周的开始，我过去常常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4051.99, "timestamp": "01:07:31", "text": "侦察并寻找"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4054.069, "timestamp": "01:07:34", "text": "呃，YouTube上的印度YouTuber，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4057.589, "timestamp": "01:07:37", "text": "Facebook、Twitter、Instagram、Tumblr"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4060.71, "timestamp": "01:07:40", "text": "尽可能多地告诉他们这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4062.63, "timestamp": "01:07:42", "text": "那里有个社区之类的。我们有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4065.75, "timestamp": "01:07:45", "text": "淋浴间里到处都是淋浴间等等。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4067.19, "timestamp": "01:07:47", "text": "你想和其他朋友交朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4069.19, "timestamp": "01:07:49", "text": "印度的 YouTube 用户们，你们可以加入并发送"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4071.51, "timestamp": "01:07:51", "text": "他们像邀请一样把他们发送给他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4074.549, "timestamp": "01:07:54", "text": "东西。我以前跑步，我以前有喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4076.789, "timestamp": "01:07:56", "text": "一份面向印度 YouTuber 的想法清单。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4079.75, "timestamp": "01:07:59", "text"